  - m_Id: 1369811542016
    m_Localized: "Th\xF4ng b\xE1o v\u1EC1 quy\u1EC1n ri\xEAng t\u01B0"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1773848846336
    m_Localized: "T\xEDnh n\u0103ng \u0111\xE1nh gi\xE1 t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng k\u1EF9
      n\u0103ng n\xF3i c\u1EA7n thu th\u1EADp d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n
      \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1EA5m \u0111i\u1EC3m v\xE0 c\u1EA3i thi\u1EC7n m\xF4 h\xECnh
      AI. Vui l\xF2ng xem c\xE1ch ch\xFAng t\xF4i x\u1EED l\xFD d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1963590770688
    m_Localized: "<u>\u0110\u1ECDc th\xF4ng b\xE1o v\u1EC1 quy\u1EC1n ri\xEAng t\u01B0</u>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2135594983424
    m_Localized: "T\xF4i \u0111\xE3 \u0111\u1ECDc v\xE0 hi\u1EC3u th\xF4ng b\xE1o
